                "title": "Brainmotic",
                "title_link": "https:\/\/hackaday.io\/project\/10600-brainmotic",
                "text": "Brainmotic comes from the union of two keywords within our project: Brain: we capture the bioelectric activity of the brain through EEG to control some elements of the common areas of a house and Domotic: that is Home Automation, achieving the word of Brainmotic! Brainmotic is a project that born with the idea that a person who has a disability or anyone, in general, could control their home using the EEG, similar to Brain-Computer Interface (BCI) and employing the technique of Motor Imagery.",
